everal invasions into the Indian Subcontinent from", "conf": 0.954, "box": [[98, 560], [822, 563], [822, 593], [98, 590]]}, {"text": "1221 to 1327.The Mongoloccupied many parts of India for decades.", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[97, 584], [664, 591], [664, 621], [97, 615]]}, {"text": "TheKhilji Dynasty", "conf": 0.87, "box": [[87, 652], [304, 659], [303, 686], [86, 679]]}, {"text": "KHIL", "conf": 0.752, "box": [[674, 673], [710, 673], [710, 684], [674, 684]]}, {"text": "(1290-1320AD)", "conf": 0.868, "box": [[88, 688], [297, 694], [296, 724], [87, 719]]}, {"text": "1320", "conf": 0.718, "box": [[746, 687], [776, 687], [776, 697], [746, 697]]}, {"text": "The Khilji dynasty ruled", "conf": 0.857, "box": [[85, 751], [312, 756], [312, 782], [85, 777]]}, {"text": "large parts of the Indian", "conf": 0.859, "box": [[86, 779], [312, 782], [312, 806], [86, 803]]}, {"text": "Subcontinent between", "conf": 0.897, "box": [[86, 804], [312, 809], [312, 832], [86, 827]]}, {"text": "1290and1320AD.Itwas", "conf": 0.896, "box": [[86, 830], [313, 833], [313, 857], [86, 853]]}, {"text": "founded by Jalal-ud-Din", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[86, 856], [313, 859], [313, 882], [86, 880]]}, {"text": "Feroz Khilji andbecame", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[86, 883], [313, 885], [313, 908], [86, 906]]}, {"text": "the second dynasty to", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[87, 909], [313, 912], [313, 935], [87, 932]]}, {"text": "ruletheDelhiSultanateof", "conf": 0.886, "box": [[87, 935], [315, 937], [315, 960], [87, 958]]}, {"text": "India.", "conf": 0.834, "box": [[86, 961], [144, 961], [144, 986], [86, 986]]}, {"text": "Alauddin Khilji", "conf": 0.854, "box": [[81, 1010], [261, 1014], [261, 1045], [80, 1040]]}, {"text": "He ruled as Sultan of Delhi from 1296-1316 AD.Alauddin Khilji ascended to the throne", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[80, 1050], [837, 1056], [837, 1082], [80, 1076]]}, {"text": "after eliminating the Sultan Jalal-ud-Din Feroz Khilji.As a ruler,he proved himself to be", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[81, 1077], 